docs\issue17-starter-corpus.md:388:Dragon-Scarred Bear (`{2}{G}`, 3/2 Bear) is sourced in `fixtures/starter-corpus/slice21-sourced.json` (Scryfall DTK 183, retrieved 2026-10-27T04:44:50Z). Formidable `{1}{G}` creates a repeatable, non-tapping regeneration shield only when current total creature power is at least 8. Shields are object-anchored, expire at cleanup, and replace only destruction (lethal-damage SBA or a destroy effect): damage is removed, the creature taps and leaves combat. Exile, bounce and zero-toughness moves do not regenerate.
